hostname ewlc-gcp
username <admin-user> privilege 15 password 0 <admin-password>
aaa new-model
aaa authentication login default local
ip http authentication local
ip http server
ip http secure-server
ip ssh version 2
line con 0
 login local
line vty 0 20
 login local
 transport input ssh
wireless management interface GigabitEthernet1
end
write memory
